ies":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"nrXtCSdfWg0TJ86onEZWkg","review_id":"QjaoLHbq-vHP6KY94WxDgQ","date":"2018-09-28T04:58:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.953346312046051,"text_excerpt":"Been here multiple times now. The burger is always a solid choice. One of my favorite in the city. Today however I had their weekly special. A chicken bacon ranch sandwich and boy it was so worth it. The chicken was perfectly crispy on their great bun. They even had a tomato sauce that gave it another layer as well. So great. Also their onion rings are some of my favorite. When dining in, their mayo bar is great. Great place to have a casual lunch or dinner."},{"business_id":"nrXtCSdfWg0TJ86onEZWkg","review_id":"O0SianGnuWyREUMTxhWH1Q","date":"2016-12-04T02:45:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9395652413368225,"text_excerpt":"I recently went here one evening before a concert and I have to tell you, this was a great experience! This location has a much more \"sleek\" feel to it although it's still casual. There is a full bar as well, which I really wish I could've taken advantage of. Now, on to the yummy goodness of the food! My friend ordered the Company Burger (double patties, American cheese, grilled onions, and homemade pickles) and onion rings. Both of these were so delicious. The burger was cooked to perfection, as as was the onion rings. She also had bacon on the burger and that was just a perfect addition! I ordered the chicken sliders since I was there at the tail end of Happy Hour. I asked the young lad..."},{"business_id":"nrXtCSdfWg0TJ86onEZWkg","review_id":"gHL64wTko0gdzH2i-HJM4w","date":"2015-11-08T00:35:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.937914252281189,"text_excerpt":"I was so happy when this location of Company Burger opened. So much easier to get to from my LGD digs than the original Freret location. Definitely your best bet for a burger in the CBD. I usually sit at the bar and order from there because why wouldn't you? I don't think you can go wrong ordering their single - it's just a classic simple burger. My friend swears by the turkey burger and I admit that if I was swearing off the beef, then it would be a great option. I'm also a fan of their grilled cheese (get it with bacon!). All of the sides are great - the fries are always crispy, there are tots and my personal favorite - PORK RINDS (get with pimiento cheese aka pimp rinds). The side port..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"nrXtCSdfWg0TJ86onEZWkg","photo_id":"1nFaoCqDbT8iMvhdIf6UKw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1nFaoCqDbT8iMvhdIf6UKw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8692089915275574},{"business_id":"nrXtCSdfWg0TJ86onEZWkg","photo_id":"uyZ-H83aJ9kutkTzpVhDwA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/uyZ-H83aJ9kutkTzpVhDwA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8685489892959595},{"business_id":"nrXtCSdfWg0TJ86onEZWkg","photo_id":"ZXC6fWcA9vQQcbAIm1jR4Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ZXC6fWcA9vQQcbAIm1jR4Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.855998694896698},{"business_id":"nrXtCSdfWg0TJ86onEZWkg","photo_id":"lVdxZDY2rKdLMJISMbZtBQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/lVdxZDY2rKdLMJISMbZtBQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8462226390838623},{"business_id":"nrXtCSdfWg0TJ86onEZWkg","photo_id":"p4QRbU6SFgmrCGOfRNDMcw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/p4QRbU6SFgmrCGOfRNDMcw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7750134468078613}]},"notebook_case":null}
